t--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/07/11/264755623/d6ce5ab274c614f72ef3e36d0191b877_1252663812028843826.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">294</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">18</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">仍是一位少女的时候，她亲手制作了这一武装。即便有很多自己认为并不完美的部分，但她还是异常珍惜地将其带在身边，直至自己的终尽。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">“毕竟······我仅仅是一个愚人而已嘛。”</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">三幕终演</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">蓄力炮，一层：单发炮弹，二层：双发更强炮弹，三层：三发超强炮弹。全伤害提高8.0%，自身攻击命中敌人时，可令其进入15.0秒【锁定】状态，重复触发刷新持续时间，【锁定】状态下的敌人移动速度降低30%，武器携带者对其造成的火焰元素伤害提高8.0%。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">变乱巴别</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:20秒]呼唤远程支援，对前方敌人所在区域进行火力覆盖，造成10*80.0%攻击力的火焰元素伤害。螺旋 · 愚戏之匣装备时，进入或对换【武装形态】会直接触发远程支援，冷却时间7.0秒，爆发状态下武器主动技变更为贯穿前方路径敌人的聚能射击，造成1,000.0%+6*50%攻击力的火焰元素伤害。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取方式</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">精准补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-消耗品</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1770/detail\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">「倒错螺旋」装备自选箱</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">置换空间</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">置换空间（概率刷出）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</sp